  'S = 1600 × (0.225) + 48 = 408mm minimum distance from hazard',
  'S = 1600 × (0.225) + 48 = 408mm — **but since 408mm < 500mm, ISO 13855 requires recalculation with K = 2000 mm/s:**\n\nS = 2000 × (0.225) + 48 = **498mm minimum distance from hazard**'
) WHERE id = 90014;

